From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dallas Delaney <dadelan@microsoft.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 02:54:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] cri: integrate signed runtime snapshotters

Refresh cached snapshotter state after unpack, propagate runtime-only snapshotter mappings and capabilities safely, derive local-pull signed-referrer handling from the selected snapshotter and diff service, preserve Azure Linux multi-snapshotter aliases, and reject deterministic required-policy mismatches without affecting overlayfs pulls.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

Copilot-Session: 925784b1-44a7-4d56-b04f-e527d2e0879f
